@startuml
title uc — ESP32-C3 CAN bench
left to right direction
actor Operator
rectangle "ESP32-C3 CAN bench firmware" {
  usecase "UC1 Start known-frame emission" as Start
  usecase "UC2 Stop emission" as Stop
  usecase "UC3 Inspect status and faults" as Status
  usecase "UC4 Read usage instructions" as Help
  usecase "UC5 Test reception with an autonomous series" as Burst
  usecase "UC6 Verify CANable transmission" as Receive
}
Operator --> Start
Operator --> Stop
Operator --> Status
Operator --> Help
Operator --> Burst
Operator --> Receive
note bottom of Burst
Autonomous build only: power-up/reset,
10 s countdown, at most 10 frames, then stop.
Precondition: isolated bench, never a charger.
end note
note bottom of Start
Precondition: physically disconnected
from every charger.
end note
@enduml
